# Reader pages (henry.ink/<url>) show someone else's writing: search engines
# should index the original, not this copy. Every static response is marked
# "do not index", and henry.ink's own pages are then unmarked by path. This
# file costs nothing per request; do not replace it with a Function.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/
  ! X-Robots-Tag
/profile/*
  ! X-Robots-Tag
/tools/*
  ! X-Robots-Tag
